Wi-Fi is terrible today. Can you hear me now?","Atsiprašau! Šiandien baisus internetas. Ar dabar mane girdite?","0f59b61d85a1",4.64],[-1,"Yes, much better.","Taip, daug geriau.",1],[0,"Okay, where was I?","Gerai, kur aš sustojau?","46a2e7bf5206",1.16],[0,"So, this month our sales are up ten percent.","Taigi, šį mėnesį mūsų pardavimai išaugo dešimčia procentų.","684e19624eed",2.62],[0,"Okay, quick updates. Who wants to go first?","Gerai, trumpai apie naujienas. Kas nori pirmas?","76266c1d466d",2.62],[-1,"I'll start.","Pradėsiu.",1],[2,"I can start...","Aš galiu pradėti...","3de04aeeaaf0",0.95],[2,"Oh, sorry! You go ahead.","Oi, atsiprašau! Kalbėk tu.","6ab58df000c6",1.55],[-3,"No, you go ahead!","Ne, kalbėk tu!",1],[2,"Thanks! So, I finished the client survey, and now I'm working on the report.","Ačiū! Taigi, baigiau klientų apklausą, o dabar dirbu prie ataskaitos.","cb9c491fad8e",4.28],[0,"Thanks, Sara! And you?","Ačiū, Sara! O tu?","ff8038375ad2",1.74],[-1,"I finished the report.","Baigiau ataskaitą.",1],[0,"Great job! Could you send me the report after the call?","Puikiai padirbėta! Ar galėtum atsiųsti man ataskaitą po skambučio?","1a23921d3b36",3.2],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"See you next week!","Iki kitos savaitės!","c57d86cb1a44",1.05],[1,"Bye, guys!","Iki, draugai!","4a1717575450",0.69],[2,"Bye!","Iki!","c373673415d1",0.64],[0,"Morning, everyone! Can everyone hear me?","Labas rytas visiems! Ar visi mane girdi?","9bc3f27f5cc0",2.43],[0,"Great!","Puiku!","1bf14c2dc0d9",0.95],[-1,"One second, please.","Sekundėlę.",1],[0,"Yes! There you are!","Taip! Štai ir tu!","eac086b35926",1.99],[-1,"Paul, you're on mute!","Paulai, tavo mikrofonas išjungtas!",1],[-2,"No, still nothing.","Ne, vis dar nieko negirdėti.",1],[1,"What about now?","O dabar?","63dcf6a004af",0.82],[-2,"Yes, we can hear you now!","Taip, dabar girdime!",1],[0,"Can everyone see my screen?","Ar visi mato mano ekraną?","665323f09e65",1.3],[-1,"It's a bit small.","Truputį per mažas.",1],[0,"Sure, let me make it bigger. Is that better?","Žinoma, padidinsiu. Ar taip geriau?","e92df55ea7c3",2.6],[-1,"It's still loading.","Dar kraunasi.",1],[0,"Great work, everyone!","Puikiai padirbėjote!","a34e6b852ed8",1.5],[-1,"I can go first.","Galiu kalbėti pirmas.",1],[0,"Great, go ahead!","Puiku, kalbėk!","a2c6a9a81c1d",1.55],[-1,"I'll finish the sales numbers by Friday.","Baigsiu pardavimų skaičius iki penktadienio.",1],[0,"Perfect, thanks!","Puiku, ačiū!","42389ffa3db1",1.41],[0,"Great. Does anyone have any questions?","Puiku. Ar kas nors turi klausimų?","ed6024c3bedf",2.51],[-1,"When's the deadline?","Koks terminas?",1],[0,"The deadline is Friday.","Terminas – penktadienis.","9959183bf30e",1.89],[0,"Anything else?","Dar kas nors?","c6f76abd8eb6",1.03],[1,"See you!","Iki!","dd31b30bff13",0.63],[0,"Hi! Can you hear me? Can you see me?","Labas! Ar mane girdite? Ar matote?","e82d8b7a6e73",2.63],[-1,"Morning, Kate! Yes, we can.","Labas rytas, Keite! Taip, girdime.",1],[-1,"I think you're muted.","Manau, tavo mikrofonas išjungtas.",1],[-1,"No, I can only see your face.","Ne, matau tik tavo veidą.",1],[-1,"Sara, you go first.","Sara, kalbėk tu pirma.",1],[-1,"I'm working on the presentation.","Dirbu prie pristatymo.",1],[0,"Sounds good. When do you think the presentation will be ready?","Gerai. Kada, tavo manymu, pristatymas bus paruoštas?","c82f215acb6f",3.09],[-1,"Goodbye!","Viso gero!",1],[0,"Bye, everyone!","Iki visiems!","8c085049957c",1.12],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"Hmm, let me check my mic. How about now?","Hmm, tuoj patikrinsiu mikrofoną. O dabar?","992cafb709ef",3.57],[-1,"Yes, we can see your screen.","Taip, matome tavo ekraną.",1],[-1,"I'm a bit behind with the budget.","Truputį vėluoju su biudžetu.",1],[0,"No worries. When do you think the budget will be ready?","Nieko tokio. Kada, tavo manymu, biudžetas bus paruoštas?","2e2e3626f897",3],[-1,"Sorry, you froze.","Atsiprašau, tavo vaizdas sustingo.",1],[-1,"Yes, I can hear you now.","Taip, dabar girdžiu.",1],[-1,"I finished the spreadsheet.","Baigiau skaičiuoklę.",1],[0,"Great job! Could you send me the spreadsheet after the call?","Puikiai padirbėta! Ar galėtum atsiųsti man skaičiuoklę po skambučio?","55bea3ff5c98",3.34],[0,"Okay, great. Just keep me posted.","Gerai, puiku. Tiesiog informuok mane.","3fbe8ab0dc4f",2.43],[0,"Okay. Any questions?","Gerai. Klausimų?","ae26a13f1223",1.76],[-1,"Could you go back to the last slide?","Ar galėtum grįžti į ankstesnę skaidrę?",1],[0,"Sure. Here it is.","Žinoma. Štai ji.","c75fe43f34cb",1.46],[0,"Hmm, let me try again. How about now?","Hmm, pabandysiu dar kartą. O dabar?","664cb09f9734",2.85],[-1,"I'll finish the newsletter by Friday.","Baigsiu naujienlaiškį iki penktadienio.",1],[1,"Sorry, guys, I have to jump off. I have another call at eleven.","Atsiprašau, draugai, turiu atsijungti – vienuoliktą turiu kitą skambutį.","c0b870aa05b1",3.26],[-2,"No questions from me.","Klausimų neturiu.",1],[0,"Okay, good.","Gerai, puiku.","2999963a517d",1.43],[0,"Okay, that's all for today. Thanks, everyone! Same time next week?","Gerai, šiandien tiek. Ačiū visiems! Tuo pačiu laiku kitą savaitę?","03b81d81b409",3.65],[-1,"Actually, I'm on vacation next week.","Tiesą sakant, kitą savaitę atostogauju.",1],[0,"Oh, no problem! I'll send you the notes.","O, jokių problemų! Atsiųsiu tau užrašus.","7b9d7a744017",2.41],[2,"Um... your camera's still on!","Ee... tavo kamera vis dar įjungta!","05d636c751bc",2.19],[-3,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[2,"Ha! No worries. Bye!","Cha! Nieko tokio. Iki!","d30b46c60747",2.23],[-1,"No questions from me.","Klausimų neturiu.",1],[0,"Great.","Puiku.","0cf134905f6d",0.74],[2,"Kate, is that a cat?","Keite, ar čia katė?","8f7c0e9339c0",1.7],[0,"Oh, yes! That's Tiger. He loves my keyboard.","O, taip! Tai Tigras. Jis dievina mano klaviatūrą.","2a72adf318f2",3.57],[1,"Hi, Tiger!","Labas, Tigrai!","26f549752fe6",0.76],[-2,"Could you share the link?","Ar galėtum pasidalinti nuoroda?",1],[0,"Sure, I'